§§ `For the parent of a child of school age (the baseline's seat)`

-- In which year does my child's kindergarten period begin?
-- c010: Chloe, born 14 March 2003, reaches 4 years 6 months in September 2007.
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period begin` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) EQUALS year 2007
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period begin` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) EQUALS (`as a year` (`the first year of my child's precompulsory education period` (Date 14 3 2003)))
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period begin` `as the student` `an unasked date` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period begin` `as the employer` `an unasked date` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

-- In which year does my child's kindergarten period end?
-- Under s 5(a), to the end of the year she reaches 5 years 6 months: September 2008.
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period end` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 4 2 2008) EQUALS year 2008
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period end` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 4 2 2008) EQUALS (`as a year` (`the last year of my child's precompulsory education period` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 4 2 2008)))
-- Under s 5(b), the same year it begins: Oliver reaches 4 years 6 months in March 2035.
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period end` `as the parent` (Date 5 9 2030) (Date 1 2 2035) EQUALS year 2035
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period end` `as the parent` (Date 5 9 2030) (Date 1 2 2035) EQUALS (`as a year` (`the last year of my child's precompulsory education period` (Date 5 9 2030) (Date 1 2 2035)))
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period end` `as the student` `an unasked date` `an unasked date` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's kindergarten period end` `as the employer` `an unasked date` `an unasked date` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

-- Is my child in the kindergarten period on this date?
#ASSERT `Is my child in the kindergarten period on this date` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 4 2 2008) EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Is my child in the kindergarten period on this date` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 4 2 2008) EQUALS (`yes if` (`Is my child in the precompulsory education period` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 4 2 2008)))
#ASSERT `Is my child in the kindergarten period on this date` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 1 2 2010) EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Is my child in the kindergarten period on this date` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 1 2 2010) EQUALS (`yes if` (`Is my child in the precompulsory education period` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 1 2 2010)))
#ASSERT `Is my child in the kindergarten period on this date` `as the student` `an unasked date` `an unasked date` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Is my child in the kindergarten period on this date` `as the employer` `an unasked date` `an unasked date` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

-- In which year does my child's compulsory education period begin?
-- c011: Chloe reaches 6 years 6 months in September 2009 (s 6(1)(a)).
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's compulsory education period begin` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 1 2 2010) EQUALS year 2009
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's compulsory education period begin` `as the parent` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 1 2 2010) EQUALS (`as a year` (`the first year of my child's compulsory education period` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 1 2 2010)))
-- k010: Jake reaches 5 years 6 months in February 2012 (s 6(1)(b)).
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's compulsory education period begin` `as the parent` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 4 2 2013) EQUALS year 2012
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's compulsory education period begin` `as the parent` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 4 2 2013) EQUALS (`as a year` (`the first year of my child's compulsory education period` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 4 2 2013)))
-- c078: Oliver reaches 5 years 6 months in March 2036.
#ASSERT `In which year does my child's compulsory education period begin` `as the parent` (Date 5 9 2030) (Date 2 2 2037) EQUALS year 2036
