-- On what day does my child's compulsory education period end?
-- k024: Jake turns 18 on 30 August 2024, before the end of 2024, the year he reaches 17 years 6 months.
#ASSERT `On what day does my child's compulsory education period end` `as the parent` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 10 11 2022) EQUALS `it ends on` (Date 30 8 2024)
#ASSERT `On what day does my child's compulsory education period end` `as the parent` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 10 11 2022) EQUALS (`as a day` (`the last day of my child's compulsory education period` (Date 30 8 2006) (Date 10 11 2022)))
-- d054: Luca reaches 17 years 6 months in August 2047; the end of 2047 comes before his 18th birthday.
#ASSERT `On what day does my child's compulsory education period end` `as the parent` (Date 2 2 2030) (Date 2 2 2037) EQUALS `it ends on` (Date 31 12 2047)
#ASSERT `On what day does my child's compulsory education period end` `as the parent` (Date 2 2 2030) (Date 2 2 2037) EQUALS (`as a day` (`the last day of my child's compulsory education period` (Date 2 2 2030) (Date 2 2 2037)))
